ClearPDF
Copyright (c) 2026 Chethan616

ClearPDF is a modified version of PdfCraft for Android
(https://github.com/artcraft-android/pdfcraft-android) by the ArtCraft Team, which is built on the
engine of PdfCraft (https://github.com/storytold/pdfcraft) by storytold and the PdfCraft
contributors. ClearPDF changed the Android app (apps/pdfcraft-android/android): its package, name,
icon, signing and release workflow, and its user interface, rewritten on ClearPDF's liquid glass
design system. The engine crates (crates/, vendor/, apps/pdfcraft-android/src) come from PdfCraft.
ClearPDF's changes are under the same terms: MIT OR Apache-2.0, at your option.

Liquid glass: the backdrop library from AndroidLiquidGlass by Kyant0
(https://github.com/Kyant0/AndroidLiquidGlass), Apache-2.0, adapted. The velocity squash-and-stretch
of glass thumbs follows LiquidTracker from AndroidLiquidGlassView by Donny Yale
(https://github.com/QmDeve/AndroidLiquidGlassView), MIT, re-implemented for Compose.

Display type: Bricolage Grotesque, Copyright 2022 The Bricolage Grotesque Project Authors
(https://github.com/ateliertriay/bricolage), SIL Open Font License 1.1
(app/src/main/assets/licences/OFL-BricolageGrotesque.txt).

The original notice of PdfCraft for Android follows.

